* ===========================================================================
* DO LOOP / WHILE / UNTIL BUFFER UNDER DOTSCRIPT?  -- the bounded probe
* ===========================================================================
*
* A PROBE, NOT A REGISTERED SPEC. Not in kRegressionSpecs; runs by DOTSCRIPT.
*
* WHY THIS WAS OWED. dotscript_control_flow_probe.dts proved SCAN was inert
* under DOTSCRIPT and that wiring the reader's buffer gate fixed it. LOOP,
* WHILE and UNTIL SHARE THAT GATE, so they came along -- unmeasured. That probe
* deliberately excluded them and said why: if a body leaks, the closing verb
* iterates an empty buffer, nothing can change the escape condition, and an
* inert loop may NOT TERMINATE. Hanging the session is an unacceptable way to
* find out.
*
* THEY ARE STUDENT TOOLS (owner, 2026-09-01), which is what moved this from
* tidiness to safety. A student is exactly the person who writes a loop with a
* broken escape, and is least equipped to tell a hang from a slow query.
*
* EVERY LOOP HERE IS EXTERNALLY BOUNDED, so a leak CANNOT hang:
*   LOOP  -- bounded by its own FOR count (3)
*   WHILE -- bounded by END OF FILE; advance_one_record breaks the loop
*   UNTIL -- bounded by END OF FILE, the same way
* A four-record fixture is the ceiling on all three.
*
* HOW IT ASSERTS. By FIELD VALUE, never console text. Each construct writes to
* its OWN column, so all three results survive to be read together and one
* failing construct cannot mask another.
*
* THE DISCRIMINATOR IS "DID THE BODY REACH A LATER RECORD". Each body writes
* the current record and then moves on -- LOOP with an explicit SKIP, WHILE and
* UNTIL by their own per-iteration advance. Buffered, the body runs many times
* and later records are written. LEAKED, THE BODY RUNS ONCE against the record
* the cursor was parked on, and only that one is written.
*
*   record 1 written  -- passes EITHER WAY. Guard, not verdict.
*   record 3 or 4     -- THE DISCRIMINATOR.
*
* Every "ran at all" guard exists because these three can fail in a SECOND way
* that has nothing to do with buffering: WHILE and UNTIL need a condition
* evaluator, and without one ENDWHILE prints "no condition evaluator; nothing
* executed" and does nothing. That failure and a leak both leave later records
* untouched. The guards tell them apart -- if a guard reads .F., the construct
* did not run and its arm proves NOTHING either way.
*
* COUNT: 4 guards + 4 arms = 8 LWU_ lines. An errored marker prints NOTHING,
* so A SHORT COUNT IS ITSELF THE RESULT. Read the count before the values.
*
* NOT COVERED HERE, deliberately: the 10,000 iteration clamp. Exercising it
* means running ten thousand iterations, which belongs at the prompt with an
* empty body rather than inside a probe that has to stay quick and quiet:
*
*     LOOP FOR 999999
*     ENDLOOP        && expect: "exceeds max 10000; clamping."
*
* Self-bootstrapping and self-erasing in DBF/SANDBOX.
* ===========================================================================

SETPATH DBF DBF/SANDBOX

ERASE LWUCTL CONFIRM

SELECT 0
CREATE X64 LWUCTL (CK C(4), M1 C(8), M2 C(8), M3 C(8))
APPEND
REPLACE CK WITH "C1"
REPLACE M1 WITH "ZERO"
REPLACE M2 WITH "ZERO"
REPLACE M3 WITH "ZERO"
APPEND
REPLACE CK WITH "C2"
REPLACE M1 WITH "ZERO"
REPLACE M2 WITH "ZERO"
REPLACE M3 WITH "ZERO"
APPEND
REPLACE CK WITH "C3"
REPLACE M1 WITH "ZERO"
REPLACE M2 WITH "ZERO"
REPLACE M3 WITH "ZERO"
APPEND
REPLACE CK WITH "C4"
REPLACE M1 WITH "ZERO"
REPLACE M2 WITH "ZERO"
REPLACE M3 WITH "ZERO"

SELECT LWUCTL
GO 4
? "LWU_G1_fixture_row4_is_C4:" + (ALLTRIM(CK) = "C4")

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* LOOP -- bounded by FOR 3. Body writes, then SKIPs forward.
* Buffered: records 1,2,3 written and record 4 left alone.
* Leaked:   record 1 only.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GO 1
LOOP FOR 3
REPLACE M1 WITH "HIT"
SKIP
ENDLOOP

GO 1
? "LWU_G2_loop_ran_at_all:" + (ALLTRIM(M1) = "HIT")
GO 3
? "LWU_T1_loop_reached_record3_DISCRIMINATOR:" + (ALLTRIM(M1) = "HIT")
GO 4
? "LWU_T2_loop_stopped_at_3_did_not_overrun:" + (ALLTRIM(M1) = "ZERO")

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* WHILE -- bounded by EOF. The condition never goes false; the record
* advance is what ends it.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GO 1
WHILE .T.
REPLACE M2 WITH "HIT"
ENDWHILE

GO 1
? "LWU_G3_while_ran_at_all:" + (ALLTRIM(M2) = "HIT")
GO 4
? "LWU_T3_while_reached_record4_DISCRIMINATOR:" + (ALLTRIM(M2) = "HIT")

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* UNTIL -- bounded by EOF. The condition never becomes true.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GO 1
UNTIL .F.
REPLACE M3 WITH "HIT"
ENDUNTIL

GO 1
? "LWU_G4_until_ran_at_all:" + (ALLTRIM(M3) = "HIT")
GO 4
? "LWU_T4_until_reached_record4_DISCRIMINATOR:" + (ALLTRIM(M3) = "HIT")
